      "complexity": "时间 `O(N log K)`（`N` 为总节点数），空间 `O(K)`。",
      "slug": "merge-k-sorted-lists",
      "leetcodeUrl": "https://leetcode.cn/problems/merge-k-sorted-lists/",
      "pitfall": "输入 lists 数组本身可能为空，或者内部包含空链表 `None/NULL`，入堆前必须先过滤掉空头节点！此外 Python 的 ListNode 没有实现 `<` 比较运算符，直接把 `(node.val, node)` 塞进 heapq 遇到相同节点值时会抛出 TypeError。",
      "isTop20": false,
      "codes": {
        "python": "import heapq\n\nclass Solution:\n    def mergeKLists(self, lists: List[Optional[ListNode]]) -> Optional[ListNode]:\n        # 将所有非空头节点放入小根堆；加入唯一递增序号 idx 打破相同 val 时的平局，避免比较 ListNode 报错\n        pq = []\n        for idx, node in enumerate(lists):\n            if node:\n                heapq.heappush(pq, (node.val, idx, node))\n\n        dummy = cur = ListNode(0)\n        uid = len(lists)\n        while pq:\n            _, _, node = heapq.heappop(pq)\n            cur.next = node\n            cur = cur.next\n            if node.next:\n                uid += 1\n                heapq.heappush(pq, (node.next.val, uid, node.next))\n        return dummy.next",
        "cpp": "class Solution {\n    struct Cmp {\n        bool operator()(ListNode* a, ListNode* b) const {\n            // priority_queue 默认大根堆，返回 > 号可反转为小根堆\n            return a->val > b->val;\n        }\n    };\n\npublic:\n    ListNode* mergeKLists(vector<ListNode*>& lists) {\n        priority_queue<ListNode*, vector<ListNode*>, Cmp> pq;\n        for (ListNode* node : lists) {\n            if (node != nullptr) {\n                pq.push(node);\n            }\n        }\n        ListNode dummy(0);\n        ListNode* cur = &dummy;\n        while (!pq.empty()) {\n            ListNode* node = pq.top();\n            pq.pop();\n            cur->next = node;\n            cur = cur->next;\n            if (node->next != nullptr) {\n                pq.push(node->next);\n            }\n        }\n        return dummy.next;\n    }\n};",
        "java": "class Solution {\n    public ListNode mergeKLists(ListNode[] lists) {\n        if (lists == null || lists.length == 0) return null;\n        // 使用 Integer.compare 构建按节点值升序的小根堆，安全防减法溢出\n        PriorityQueue<ListNode> pq = new PriorityQueue<>((a, b) -> Integer.compare(a.val, b.val));\n        for (ListNode node : lists) {\n            if (node != null) {\n                pq.offer(node);\n            }\n        }\n        ListNode dummy = new ListNode(0);\n        ListNode cur = dummy;\n        while (!pq.isEmpty()) {\n            ListNode node = pq.poll();\n            cur.next = node;\n            cur = cur.next;\n            if (node.next != null) {\n                pq.offer(node.next);\n            }\n        }\n        return dummy.next;\n    }\n}",
        "c": "static void heapPush(struct ListNode** heap, int* size, struct ListNode* node) {\n    int i = (*size)++;\n    while (i > 0) {\n        int p = (i - 1) / 2;\n        if (heap[p]->val <= node->val) break;\n        heap[i] = heap[p];\n        i = p;\n    }\n    heap[i] = node;\n}\n\nstatic struct ListNode* heapPop(struct ListNode** heap, int* size) {\n    struct ListNode* top = heap[0];\n    struct ListNode* last = heap[--(*size)];\n    int i = 0;\n    while (i * 2 + 1 < *size) {\n        int child = i * 2 + 1;\n        if (child + 1 < *size && heap[child + 1]->val < heap[child]->val) {\n            child++;\n        }\n        if (last->val <= heap[child]->val) break;\n        heap[i] = heap[child];\n        i = child;\n    }\n    if (*size > 0) heap[i] = last;\n    return top;\n}\n\nstruct ListNode* mergeKLists(struct ListNode** lists, int listsSize) {\n    if (lists == NULL || listsSize == 0) return NULL;\n    struct ListNode** heap = (struct ListNode**)malloc(sizeof(struct ListNode*) * listsSize);\n    int heapSize = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < listsSize; i++) {\n        if (lists[i] != NULL) {\n            heapPush(heap, &heapSize, lists[i]);\n        }\n    }\n    struct ListNode dummy = {0, NULL};\n    struct ListNode* cur = &dummy;\n    while (heapSize > 0) {\n        struct ListNode* node = heapPop(heap, &heapSize);\n        cur->next = node;\n        cur = node;\n        if (node->next != NULL) {\n            heapPush(heap, &heapSize, node->next);\n        }\n    }\n    free(heap);\n    return dummy.next;\n}"
      },
      "langNotes": {
        "python": "Python 的 `heapq` 模块天然是小根堆，按元组字典序逐项比较：当两个节点的 `val` 相同时会继续比较第二项，而 `ListNode` 未定义 `__lt__` 方法会报错。塞入三元组 `(node.val, uid, node)` 让互不相同的整数 `uid` 在第二项直接分出胜负，永远不会触发第三项 `node` 的比较！",
        "cpp": "C++ 的 `std::priority_queue` 默认使用 `std::less` 构建**大根堆**！自定义比较器结构体 `Cmp` 时必须反向写成 `return a->val > b->val;` 才能令最小值浮在堆顶。",
        "java": "Java 的 `PriorityQueue` 默认即为小根堆，传入 Lambda `(a, b) -> Integer.compare(a.val, b.val)` 比直接写 `a.val - b.val` 更专业，能彻底避免极端负数减正数时的整型溢出风险。",
        "c": "C 语言没有内置优先队列，手写一个容量为 `listsSize` 的二叉小根堆（`heapPush` 上浮与 `heapPop` 下沉仅二十余行）非常固定好记，能在 O(N log K) 时间内高效合并，记得在退出前 `free(heap)`。"
      }
