      "pitfall": "三大生死坑点：① 忘记初始化前缀和 `cnt[0] = 1`（漏统计从根直接出发的路径）；② DFS 离开当前节点返回父节点前**忘记执行 `cnt[cur_sum] -= 1` 回溯恢复现场**（导致左子树的前缀和污染到右子树非祖孙路径！）；③ 节点值可达 `10^9`，C++/Java/C 的前缀和不用 64 位整数必溢出！",
      "isTop20": false,
      "codes": {
        "python": "from collections import defaultdict\n\nclass Solution:\n    def pathSum(self, root: Optional[TreeNode], targetSum: int) -> int:\n        # 树上的“和为 K 的子数组（第 560 题）”：前缀和哈希表 + 回溯恢复现场\n        cnt = defaultdict(int)\n        cnt[0] = 1\n\n        def dfs(node: Optional[TreeNode], cur_sum: int) -> int:\n            if not node:\n                return 0\n            cur_sum += node.val\n            # 1. 先查有多少个祖先前缀和等于 cur_sum - targetSum（必须在 cnt[cur_sum] += 1 之前查，防 targetSum == 0 时自己减自己）\n            res = cnt[cur_sum - targetSum]\n            # 2. 将当前前缀和记入哈希表，供下方左右子树查询\n            cnt[cur_sum] += 1\n            res += dfs(node.left, cur_sum)\n            res += dfs(node.right, cur_sum)\n            # 3. 灵魂回溯：离开当前子树前撤销记录，绝不能污染兄弟分支！\n            cnt[cur_sum] -= 1\n            return res\n\n        return dfs(root, 0)",
        "cpp": "class Solution {\n    unordered_map<long long, int> cnt;\n\n    int dfs(TreeNode* node, long long curSum, long long targetSum) {\n        if (node == nullptr) return 0;\n        curSum += node->val;\n        int res = 0;\n        auto it = cnt.find(curSum - targetSum);\n        if (it != cnt.end()) {\n            res += it->second;\n        }\n        cnt[curSum]++;\n        res += dfs(node->left, curSum, targetSum);\n        res += dfs(node->right, curSum, targetSum);\n        cnt[curSum]--; // 回溯恢复现场\n        return res;\n    }\n\npublic:\n    int pathSum(TreeNode* root, int targetSum) {\n        cnt.clear();\n        cnt[0] = 1;\n        return dfs(root, 0LL, targetSum);\n    }\n};",
        "java": "class Solution {\n    public int pathSum(TreeNode root, int targetSum) {\n        Map<Long, Integer> cnt = new HashMap<>();\n        cnt.put(0L, 1);\n        return dfs(root, 0L, targetSum, cnt);\n    }\n\n    private int dfs(TreeNode node, long curSum, long targetSum, Map<Long, Integer> cnt) {\n        if (node == null) return 0;\n        curSum += node.val;\n        int res = cnt.getOrDefault(curSum - targetSum, 0);\n        cnt.put(curSum, cnt.getOrDefault(curSum, 0) + 1);\n        res += dfs(node.left, curSum, targetSum, cnt);\n        res += dfs(node.right, curSum, targetSum, cnt);\n        // 回溯：当前节点方向搜索完毕，将其前缀和频次减 1\n        cnt.put(curSum, cnt.get(curSum) - 1);\n        return res;\n    }\n}",
        "c": "#define HASH_CAP 4096\n#define HASH_MASK (HASH_CAP - 1)\n\ntypedef struct {\n    long long keys[HASH_CAP];\n    int vals[HASH_CAP];\n    bool used[HASH_CAP];\n} PrefixMap;\n\nstatic unsigned int hashLL(long long x) {\n    unsigned long long u = (unsigned long long)x;\n    u ^= u >> 33;\n    u *= 0xff51afd7ed558ccdULL;\n    u ^= u >> 33;\n    return (unsigned int)u & HASH_MASK;\n}\n\nstatic int mapGet(const PrefixMap* mp, long long key) {\n    unsigned int idx = hashLL(key);\n    while (mp->used[idx]) {\n        if (mp->keys[idx] == key) return mp->vals[idx];\n        idx = (idx + 1) & HASH_MASK;\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n\nstatic void mapAdd(PrefixMap* mp, long long key, int delta) {\n    unsigned int idx = hashLL(key);\n    while (mp->used[idx] && mp->keys[idx] != key) {\n        idx = (idx + 1) & HASH_MASK;\n    }\n    mp->used[idx] = true;\n    mp->keys[idx] = key;\n    mp->vals[idx] += delta;\n}\n\nstatic int dfs(struct TreeNode* node, long long curSum, long long targetSum, PrefixMap* mp) {\n    if (node == NULL) return 0;\n    curSum += node->val;\n    int res = mapGet(mp, curSum - targetSum);\n    mapAdd(mp, curSum, 1);\n    res += dfs(node->left, curSum, targetSum, mp);\n    res += dfs(node->right, curSum, targetSum, mp);\n    mapAdd(mp, curSum, -1); // 回溯恢复频次\n    return res;\n}\n\nint pathSum(struct TreeNode* root, int targetSum) {\n    PrefixMap mp;\n    memset(&mp, 0, sizeof(mp));\n    mapAdd(&mp, 0LL, 1);\n    return dfs(root, 0LL, (long long)targetSum, &mp);\n}"
      },
      "langNotes": {
        "python": "Python 整数自动扩为任意精度大整数，天然免疫 `10^9 * 1000` 的路径累加溢出！使用 `defaultdict(int)` 时注意先读 `res = cnt[cur_sum - targetSum]` 再写 `cnt[cur_sum] += 1`（否则当 `targetSum == 0` 时会把空路径误算进去），且函数末尾的 `cnt[cur_sum] -= 1` 是整道题的灵魂。",
        "cpp": "C++ 力扣专门新增了连续多个 `1000000000` 节点的链状用例，所以哈希表键类型和累加和必须用 `long long`（`unordered_map<long long, int>`）！查询时用 `cnt.find(...)` 而不是直接读 `cnt[curSum - targetSum]`，避免未命中时在哈希表里白白插入大量值为 0 的冗余键。",
        "java": "Java 必须采用 `Map<Long, Integer>` 搭配 `0L` 防御 `int` 溢出。借助 `getOrDefault` 实现优雅的频次读写，回溯时直接 `cnt.put(curSum, cnt.get(curSum) - 1)` 即可（频次归零无需 `remove`，不会影响正确性）。",
        "c": "C 语言节点数上限 1000，设计一个容量 4096 的 `long long -> int` 开放定址哈希表（回溯减 1 时仅将 `vals[idx]` 减为 0 而无需物理删除槽位，甚至省去了墓碑标记！），相比暴力双重 DFS 的 O(n^2) 实现了真正的 O(n) 最优复杂度。"
      }
